    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi mwanace jwa Yotamu ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku cilambo ca Yuda. Mcaka ca 17 ca ucimwene wa Peka ku cilambo ca Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵajinjile ucimwene ali ni yaka 20, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka 16 ku Yelusalemu. Jwalakwe nginatenda yindu yakulungamika pameso pa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mpela muŵatendele Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ambujegwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwalakweju ŵakuyisye ndamo syakusakala sya ayimwene ŵane ŵa ku Isalaeli. Ŵampelece mwanace jwakwe jwamlume kumtaga mbopesi jakutinisya, ŵakuyisye misyungu jakunyalaya ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jiŵajitopwesye AMBUJE mcilambomo, pa ndaŵi jiŵayikaga Aisalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 12:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi ŵatasile mbopesi ni kututumisya ubani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi milungu ja cilendo, pa matumbi, ni kusi kwa yitela yagudulila masamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jele Ahasi ŵaliji mkulamulila Yuda, mwenye jwa ku Edomu ŵawusumwile msinda wa Elati kutyocela kwa Yuda, ni ŵawuwusisye soni kwa Aedomu, jemanjajo ŵatopwesye Ayuda wosope nipo akutama mu msinda welewu mpaka lelo jino. (Ndaŵi jijojo Mwenye Lesini jwa ku Siliya ni Mwenye Peka jwa ku Isalaeli ŵayice kuputa ngondo ku ŵandu ŵa mu msinda wa Yelusalemu, nambo ŵalepele kuwusumula msindawo).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5+2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5",
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5+2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5",
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi ŵatumisye mtenga kwa Tigilati Pilesa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya wakusala kuti, “Ŵakucimbicika mwenye, une ndili mwanagwenu soni jwakutumicila jwenu. Conde yikani akuno kukungulupusya m'magasa ga Lesini mwenye jwa ku Siliya ni Peka mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ŵayice akuno ni ngondo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi ŵajigele silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " juŵamsimene m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni m'nyumba ja kusunjila cipanje ca mwenye, ni ŵayitumisye mpela mtuka kwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Tigilati Pilesa piŵapocele utengawo, jwalakwe ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵajawile ku Asiliya kuputa ngondo. Ŵasumwile msinda wawukulungwa wa Damasiko, ŵamwuleje Mwenye Lesini, ŵajigele ŵandu ŵa mu msindawo mpela akayidi kuja nawo ku msinda wa Kili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jiŵajawile Mwenye Ahasi ku Damasiko kuti akasimane ni Mwenye Tigilati Pilesa, ŵagaweni malo gakupelecela mbopesi kweleko, ŵajambwile pulani ja mwele mugawonecelaga malo gakupelecela mbopesigo, ni ŵamtumicisye Uliya jwakutaga mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwakutaga mbopesi Uliya ŵataŵile malo gakupelecela mbopesigo, Mwenye Ahasi mkanawuje kutyocela ku Damasiko. Ŵagataŵile malo gakupelecela mbopesigo pakukuya pulani jiŵatumisye Mwenye Ahasi kutyocela ku Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵawusile Mwenye Ahasi kutyocela ku Damasiko, ŵasimene kuti malo gakupelecela mbopesi gemale kutaŵa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenyejo ŵatasile mbopesi sya nyama syakutinisya, ni mbopesi sya yakulya. Ŵatasile soni mbopesi sya yakumwa, ni ŵamisile miasi ja mbopesi ja mkamulano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pacanya pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali amasile kutaga mbopesisyo, Mwenye Ahasi ŵatyosisye malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga bulonsi giŵataŵile AMBUJE, gigaliji cilikati ca malo gakupelecela mbopesi gasambano gala ni Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni ŵagaŵisile ca kumpoto kwa malo gakupelecela mbopesi gakwe gala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1+EXO.27.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 27:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mbi 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mwenye ŵamsalile Uliya jwakutaga mbopesi kuti, “Kutandila lelo, mkamulisyeje masengo malo gakupelecela mbopesi gamakulungwa ga unega, pakutaga mbopesi sya kundaŵi sya kutinisya, ni mbopesi sya ligulo sya yakulya. Mpeleceje soni mbopesi ja kundaŵi jakutinisya ni mbopesi ja ligulo ja yakulya ja mwenye ni ja ŵandu wosope ŵa mcilambomo, pamo ni yakupeleka ya yakumwa. Mpungulile pacanya pakwe miasi ja nyama syosope syakupelecedwa mbopesi syakutinisya. Nambo malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga bulonsi mundecele uneji, tinagakamulisyeje masengo pa ndaŵi jingupopela ni pangusaka kupata kumanyilila yakusosa Mlungu kuti uneji nayitende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uliya ŵayitesile yindu yosopeyo mpela muŵalamulile Mwenye Ahasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahasi ŵagopwele mafelemu ga yipaka yiyaliji m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni ŵatyosisye libeseni. Ciŵiga ciŵacitamice pacanya pa ng'ombe sya bulonsi, ŵacitulwisye ni ŵaciŵisile pacanya pa maganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26+1KI.7.27+1KI.7.28+1KI.7.29+1KI.7.30+1KI.7.31+1KI.7.32+1KI.7.33+1KI.7.34+1KI.7.35+1KI.7.36+1KI.7.37+1KI.7.38+1KI.7.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 7:23-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.2+2CH.4.3+2CH.4.4+2CH.4.5+2CH.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mbi 4:2-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo pa kusaka kumnonyelesya Tigilati Pilesa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, Ahasi ŵatyosisye m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, malo giŵatamikaga mpando ŵawucimwene, ni soni ŵawugele mlango wapasa uŵajinjililaga mwenye mkati mwa Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gane gaŵatesile Ahasi piŵaliji mwenye, galembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile ku malembe ga ucimwene ku Yelusalemu. Myoyo Hesekiya mwanace jwakwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
